[7133.870887, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[7133.996279, "o", "NAME:\r\n   gitea completion - Output shell completion script for bash, zsh, fish, or Powershell\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n   gitea completion [command [command options]]\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION:\r\n   Output shell completion script for bash, zsh, fish, or Powershell.\r\n   Source the output to enable completion.\r\n\r\n   # .bashrc\r\n   source <(gitea completion bash)\r\n\r\n   # .zshrc\r\n   source <(gitea completion zsh)\r\n\r\n   # fish\r\n   gitea completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/gitea.fish\r\n\r\n   # Powershell\r\n   Output the script to path/to/autocomplete/gitea.ps1 and run it.\r\n\r\n\r\nCOMMANDS:\r\n   bash  Output bash completion script\r\n   zsh   Output zsh completion script\r\n   fish  Output fish completion script\r\n   pwsh  Output pwsh completion script\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n   --help, -h  show help\r\n\r\nDEFAULT CONFIGURATION:\r\n   AppPath:    /usr/local/bin/gitea\r\n   WorkPath:   /usr/local/bin\r\n   CustomPath: /usr/local/bin/custom\r\n   ConfigFile: /usr/local/bin/custom/conf/app.ini\r\n\r\n"]
